rget versions were healthy in production before, so neither rollback needs change-manager approval. I can start as soon as you pick one.", "context": {}}, {"t_ms": 132863, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc1", "decision": "answer", "message": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker.", "latency_ms": 112702, "hint": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 132863, "event": "principal_reply", "actor": "human", "text": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker."}, {"t_ms": 136992, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014LKiLA9WQR1hRsDaCbLPFh", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 140992, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014LKiLA9WQR1hRsDaCbLPFh", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 140992, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014LKiLA9WQR1hRsDaCbLPFh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 140992, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0121bpTyy33HEWrB7UvdibK4", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker errors after v3.4.0 deploy", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "payments-worker v3.4.0 (this morning's deploy) went unhealthy in production with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. payments-api (v5.1.0, degraded, 18% errors) is failing downstream of the worker. Rolling payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its last release that was healthy in production. Watching payments-api to see if it recovers.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 141592, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0121bpTyy33HEWrB7UvdibK4", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 141592, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0121bpTyy33HEWrB7UvdibK4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 143535, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BVZXPCYat5BaWzSSp4xVmg", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 143835, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BVZXPCYat5BaWzSSp4xVmg", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 143835, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BVZXPCYat5BaWzSSp4xVmg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 143835, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019brwRVu8EhGm5wSDZQX3Ax", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 144135, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019brwRVu8EhGm5wSDZQX3Ax", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 144135, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019brwRVu8EhGm5wSDZQX3Ax", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 148964, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0 and opened the SEV2. The worker has recovered, but payments-api is still failing.\n\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker is on v3.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It now shows healthy, and its error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV2, payments-worker) and it paged on-call. The summary says the API errors are downstream of the worker.\n- **payments-api:** it's still degraded on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate, checked right after the rollback. It may just need more time to recover, for example while retries or queued work clear. If it stays at that level, the problem may be in payments-api v5.1.0 itself, which was also a recent release.\n\nI haven't changed payments-api. If its errors don't come down soon, I can roll it back to v5.0.0, its last release that was healthy in production. That doesn't need change-manager approval. Tell me if you want me to do that.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016kNJd6WJLtgs9sdCRci7Ke", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01C4HNk8AKPhd7oJ7ihAaY6K", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Bu5C9RSkDLbBgmTHUysgNq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01BpYqquUeWb4Y35vSyBw5bj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0112zZmeoMhkF6VDFAuawBkj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VNXu1dSujdi4bE5DeNprwD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "na