0001 (SEV2, payments-worker) and it paged on-call. The summary says the API errors are downstream of the worker.\n- **payments-api:** it's still degraded on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate, checked right after the rollback. It may just need more time to recover, for example while retries or queued work clear. If it stays at that level, the problem may be in payments-api v5.1.0 itself, which was also a recent release.\n\nI haven't changed payments-api. If its errors don't come down soon, I can roll it back to v5.0.0, its last release that was healthy in production. That doesn't need change-manager approval. Tell me if you want me to do that.", "type": "text"}]}]}